betterquesting:10.desc:8:
Raw Hyperdense Stellar Plasma is too loose to seed a neutron star, so finish it inside a black hole. The Kerr Compressor Module runs §bKerr Densification§r, only on a §bKerr T2 holding at least 128 SM§r:
- §b10,000 L Raw Hyperdense Stellar Plasma + 288 L molten SpaceTime + 64 Neutronium bolts → 1,000 L Hyperdense Stellar Mixture§r, 20 s at UMV, before the hole's bonus.

Hyperdense Stellar Mixture (HSM) is used for:
- the Core Collapse's neutron seed (5,000 L);
- feeding the neutron star (0-1.5 L/s);
- the Galactic Upgrade Core (32,000 L, as its condensate);
- Galactic Shell Plating and Star Chart: Neutron Star.

[note]Raise the KEE's setpoint to 128 SM or more before you start: below that the module refuses the recipe.[/note]

§a§lDONE WHEN§r you hold 1,000 L of Hyperdense Stellar Mixture.

The Conduit will carry the quasar's bursts anywhere, with no loss:
- a §bWormhole Mouth§r pair, linked with a data stick, at any distance, other dimensions included;
- §bMirrors§r to turn a stream;
- §bJunctions§r to split a stream (steerable by redstone) or combine up to three.
Upkeep is molten SpaceTime before T7 and Ergomatter after. §bGRB Receptor Ports§r take the stream: on the Eye's rail, and on the Kerr, the Homogeny and Reality Diffraction, which a quasar can stabilise too.

[note]§lComing in a later update.§r This part of Beyond the Stars is designed but not built yet, so the quest is a checkbox: tick it to keep the chapter moving. The numbers above are the current plan and may change. When it ships, this quest gets its real tasks under the same id, and a ticked box is cleared so the real step counts.[/note]

ops.desc:
§lFirst Light.§r Sol's product: 50,000 L a cycle × your yield. NEI calls it Condensed Raw Stellar Plasma Mixture, and the Eye's GUI and tooltips call it Raw Star Matter.

It goes into:
- Sirius A's upkeep (25,000 L a cycle);
- the §bStellar Mass Core§r that unlocks T2 (256,000 L);
- the §bKerr Density Upgrade§r (4,000,000 L);
- Beam Band and Jet Crescent casings, star charts, and Sirius B's overshoot trim;
- the Stellar Catalyst, as before.
For the Condensate Assembler it is condensed 1 : 1 into §bEntangled Raw Star Matter§r first (NEI: Condensate Entanglement).

[note]Your first milestone is counting already: §l20,000,000 L§r made on this Eye and §l2 h Resonant§r open the road to T2.[/note]
